Cube both sides of the equation to get rid of the cube root: $\displaystyle 3-x=-\dfrac{27}{8}$.
Add $x$ to both sides and simplify: $x=\dfrac{27}{8}+3=\dfrac{27}{8}+\dfrac{24}{8}=\dfrac{51}{8}$.
